    <item>
      <title>The Topology of a Product Team </title>
      <link>https://jnrjose.org/p/the-topology-of-a-product-team</link>
      <description>There’s this weird myth that if you hire enough product managers, designers, and engineers, poof, you become a product-driven company. Spoiler: you don’t. I’ve lost count of how many PMs have vented to me about feeling like glorified project managers</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://jnrjose.org/p/the-topology-of-a-product-team</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/youtube/w_728,c_limit/K1WrHH-WtaA" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 04:00:56 +0000</pubDate>
